{"id":"9afdcade5183fc9d","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Almost Everywhere Convergence","display":"df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence — ZFC Measure3 Almost Everywhere Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence — ZFC Measure3 Almost Everywhere Convergence","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-almost-everywhere-convergence — ZFC Measure3 Almost Everywhere Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\vec f,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\vec f,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3AlmostEverywhereConvergence}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3AlmostEverywhereConvergence}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}almost\\text{-}everywhere\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3AlmostEverywhereConvergence}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\vec f,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec f))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\vec f(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\land\\mu\\left(\\{x\\in X:\\neg\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to\\lvert \\vec f(n)(x)-f(x)\\rvert&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\right)=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}almost\\text{-}everywhere\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3AlmostEverywhereConvergence}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\vec f,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec f))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\vec f(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\land\\mu\\left(\\{x\\in X:\\neg\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to\\lvert \\vec f(n)(x)-f(x)\\rvert&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\right)=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The convergence relation is expanded by its epsilon definition and all participating functions are required to be measurable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\vec f,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3AlmostEverywhereConvergence}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}almost\\text{-}everywhere\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3AlmostEverywhereConvergence}_S(